+<main><section class="wrap hero"><div class="eyebrow">Pricing that stays simple</div><h1>More connected.<br>Less complicated.</h1><p>Everything your team needs to do its best work, with a plan that grows with you.</p><div class="billing" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Billing frequency"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-period="monthly">Monthly</button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-period="yearly">Yearly <span class="save">SAVE 20%</span></button></div><div class="billing-note" id="billing-note" aria-live="polite">Billed monthly. Change or cancel anytime.</div></section>
+<section class="wrap plans" id="plans" aria-label="Plans">
+<article class="plan"><h2>Free</h2><p class="blurb">A calmer way for small teams to get in sync.</p><div class="price"><span class="currency">$</span><span class="amount" data-monthly="0" data-yearly="0">0</span><span class="per">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billing-detail">Always free</div><hr class="rule"><h3>Start with the essentials</h3><ul class="features"><li><span class="check">✓</span> Up to 5 members</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> Unlimited messages</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> 1:1 audio and video calls</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> 10 GB shared storage</li></ul><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Get%20started%20with%20Relay%20Free">Get started</a></article>
+<article class="plan featured"><span class="badge">Most popular</span><h2>Team</h2><p class="blurb">The full toolkit for teams doing great things together.</p><div class="price"><span class="currency">$</span><span class="amount" data-monthly="8" data-yearly="6.40">8</span><span class="per">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billing-detail" data-detail="team">Billed monthly</div><hr class="rule"><h3>Everything in Free, plus</h3><ul class="features"><li><span class="check">✓</span> Unlimited members and message history</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> Group audio and video calls</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> 1 TB shared storage</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> Integrations and workflow automation</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> Priority support</li></ul><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Get%20started%20with%20Relay%20Team">Choose Team</a></article>
