+<section class="wrap faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="faq-heading">A few good questions</h2><p>Still wondering? We’re happy to help.</p></div><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><p>Absolutely. Upgrade or downgrade whenever your team’s needs change. Your settings and conversation history stay with you.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing and you’ll save 20% per user compared with paying month to month. The displayed price is the equivalent monthly rate, billed annually.</p></details><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Yes. The Free plan is free to use, with no credit card required. You can move to Team or Business whenever you’re ready.</p></details><details><summary>What happens if I cancel?</summary><p>You can cancel a paid plan at any time. You’ll keep access through the end of your billing period, and can continue on Free afterward.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help setting up our workspace?</summary><p>Every plan includes a straightforward self-serve setup. Business also includes personalized onboarding to help your organization get rolling.</p></details></section></main>
